I just started using nouveau yesterday (after I lost my temper with the
Nvidia 'driver' for the last time) and have found it *excellent* so far
--- it works as well as nv on my card (GeForce 6150 Go) with xrandr1.2
as well, which is brilliant. One weird bug I noticed, which seems to be
related to using the nouveau drivers, is that any bold text appears with
